nt is a city with a population of 265,000 in 2020, with rich history. During the Middle Ages, Ghent was one of the richest and most powerful cities in Europe. The impact of this rich past can be clearly seen when viewing the imposing architecture of churches and the houses of rich traders. The city centre is restored, and breathes the atmosphere of a thriving late-medieval city state. It is free of cars, so it is a very welcoming and open area.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Ghent","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Ghent","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Ghent is a medieval city in Belgium, gothic in style and compact enough to walk. Gravensteen, Saint Bavo Cathedral and the Museum of Fine Arts Ghent are the leaders, about ten hours of sights. May to September is the season.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":265086,"visit_h":9.6}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-gravensteen","name":"Gravensteen","kind":"Castle","lat":51.05718,"lon":3.72077,"dist_km":0.4,"sig":2.526,"rank_score":11.03,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"château et musée en Belgique","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Gent%2C_Het_Gravensteen_oeg25890_vanaf_de_Hoofdbrug_IMG_0431_2021-08-13_18.28.jpg/960px-Gent%2C_Het_Gravensteen_oeg25890_vanaf_de_Hoofdbrug_IMG_0431_2021-08-13_18.28.jpg","author":"Michielverbeek","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gent,_Het_Gravensteen_oeg25890_vanaf_de_Hoofdbrug_IMG_0431_2021-08-13_18.28.jpg","ok_print":true},"wikipedia":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C3%A2teau_des_comtes_de_Flandre","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-museum-of-fine-arts-ghent-msk","name":"Museum of Fine Arts Ghent (MSK)","kind":"Museum","lat":51.03798,"lon":3.72424,"dist_km":1.9,"rank_score":10.84,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/MSK19122008.JPG/960px-MSK19122008.JPG","author":"Pa